00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:39.120
Engine if you have Unreal Engine and you're going&nbsp;
to have a a camera tracker what gets mounted on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:44.360
the top of the camera and depending on the type&nbsp;
of camera tracking solution you're using you're&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:49.920
going to have it depends like if you're using&nbsp;
Moses you're going to have these little star&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:53.440
